      "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"dsh-code-rag-index-panel\",\n  \"version\": \"1.4.1\",\n  \"description\": \"DeepSeek Harness 插件：Code RAG 索引面板（会话输入框上方的索引状态条与开始/全量重建/取消按钮，数据直连 code-rag MCP 服务器的本地 HTTP 端点）+ 设置页「插件」区诊断与配置卡片（/api/code-rag/* 环回端点），索引条显示范围可在设置中切换（默认仅 Code RAG 模式会话），界面中英双语。\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"deepseek\", \"harness\", \"dsh\", \"cordis\", \"plugin\", \"code-rag\", \"index\", \"panel\"],\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": \"./lib/index.js\",\n    \"./client\": \"./lib/client.js\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\"lib\", \"assets\", \"screenshots.json\", \"cordis.patch.yml\", \"README.md\", \"README.zh.md\", \"LICENSE\"],\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/Ankali-Aylina/code-rag.git\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"schemastery\": \"^3.18.0\"\n  },\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"client\": {\n      \"inject\": [\"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime\"],\n      \"platform\": \"web\"\n    },\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"*\",\n    \"react\": \"^18.2.0\"\n  }\n}\n"
